      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://www.gavalier.sk/tvorba-webu/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Ko\u013eko stoj\u00ed web na mieru?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Z\u00e1kazky beriem od p\u00e1r desiatok eur po tis\u00edce, pod\u013ea rozsahu. Drobn\u00e1 \u00faprava na pol hodiny je rovnako legit\u00edmna z\u00e1kazka ako projekt na tri mesiace. Cenu poviem dopredu a plat\u00ed."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Pre\u010do web na mieru a nie \u0161abl\u00f3na?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u0160abl\u00f3na nemus\u00ed zodpoveda\u0165 tomu, \u010do v\u00e1\u0161 biznis potrebuje, a \u010dasto je prepl\u00e1can\u00e1 prvkami, ktor\u00e9 nepou\u017eijete. Na mieru dostanete presne to, \u010do treba, s \u010dist\u00fdm k\u00f3dom."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Viem si web po odovzdan\u00ed upravova\u0165 s\u00e1m?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no. Ak chcete, nasad\u00edm CMS pre netechnikov, v ktorom si texty, fotky aj ceny uprav\u00edte kliknut\u00edm a ulo\u017een\u00edm, bez \u010dakania na program\u00e1tora."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Postar\u00e1te sa o hosting a dom\u00e9nu?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no. Zabezpe\u010d\u00edm hosting, dom\u00e9nu aj nasadenie, tak\u017ee sa nemus\u00edte stara\u0165 o technick\u00fa str\u00e1nku."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Star\u00e1m sa o web aj po spusten\u00ed?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no. Odovzdan\u00edm spolupr\u00e1ca nekon\u010d\u00ed. Ke\u010f po \u010dase potrebujete nie\u010do prida\u0165 alebo doladi\u0165, sta\u010d\u00ed zavola\u0165."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Dok\u00e1\u017eete web aj upravi\u0165, nielen postavi\u0165 nov\u00fd?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no. Z\u00e1kazka m\u00f4\u017ee by\u0165 aj mal\u00e1 \u00faprava existuj\u00faceho webu."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Pracujete aj mimo Popradu?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no, pre klientov na celom Slovensku. Z\u00e1kladom je telefon\u00e1t alebo e-mail."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
